    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="09b3a989-6248-5d3e-94c2-db9f9778e4d6" activityNameId="9e1ed321-084b-5b99-8165-3ebef8065091" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation equipment, GE 250 RH, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation equipment, GE 250 RH, at plant
Production of a typical component used for a decentral ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: a3791578-3e2a-37e3-a690-0c49c9e5999b
Materials used for the production. Estimation of electricity use for the different production steps. Energy use for heating of the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for the Infrastructure of the Production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Ventilation unit for decentral ventilation systems with 120 m3/h average air flow. Housing made of galvanised steel and stainless steel insulated with rock wool. Heat recovery element made of aluminium. Total weight of component 65 kg
Time period: Materials investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Technical information of producer. Data of one common product used. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a3791578-3e2a-37e3-a690-0c49c9e5999b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
